from __future__ import annotations


def revise_pairs(pairs: dict[str, tuple[str, str]]) -> dict[str, tuple[str, str]]:
    pairs.update({
        "R1-2": (
            "我们同意您的观点，并采纳共同可靠性约束。2019年基准窗口估计的非负裕量原样用于2020年起的八个窗口，四国八种策略的256个策略—窗口组合均达到0.95经验覆盖，最低为0.952。正文和补充材料同时列出调整后的覆盖、成本、MW备用及尾部缺额，并完整比较八种策略。所选局部策略相对全局校准的平均成本增益在德国、奥地利、比利时和荷兰分别为0.000026、0.000187、0.000068和0.000163；奥地利和荷兰的四国多重校正区间下界为正。结果把可靠性门槛、采购量和成本放在同一冻结协议下评价。",
            "We agree with your view and adopted a common reliability constraint. The nonnegative margin estimated from the 2019 benchmark windows is applied unchanged to eight windows beginning in 2020. All 256 policy-window combinations across four countries and eight policies reach 0.95 empirical coverage, with a minimum of 0.952. The manuscript and supplement report adjusted coverage, cost, reserve in MW, and tail shortfall for all eight policies. Selected-local mean cost gains over global calibration are 0.000026, 0.000187, 0.000068, and 0.000163 in Germany, Austria, Belgium, and the Netherlands; Austria and the Netherlands have positive lower endpoints after adjustment for the four-country comparison. The results evaluate reliability, procurement quantity, and cost under the same frozen protocol."),
        "R2-1": (
            "我们讨论后采纳了同条件替代接口比较的建议。48条独立请求各重复五次，比较JSON对象、JSON模式和函数调用；24条共同请求包含三位专家输入的72份表单及其有限状态流程，增强解析器使用相同字段和验证规则。混元准确率分别为0.663、0.833和0.904，后两项相对JSON对象的Holm校正p值均小于0.001。补充材料同时列出误澄清、执行就绪错误、延迟和token。资源评价采用明确报价下的token预算：四服务每次请求的共同报价预算为0.006688、0.003943、0.006782和0.026955元，其中千问按其公布标准价估算。维护规格量化六个区域、三种时域、三种缺额权重、九类允许变量、六类受限信息与行为及五个流程状态，并列出表单、解析规则、生成模式、提示和供应商设置的维护对象。人工配对结果进一步给出字段修正数量和复核时间阈值。上述比较评价语言解释、结构生成、固定验证及人工复核各自的贡献。",
            "We discussed and adopted the matched-interface comparison. The 48 independent requests receive five trials with JSON objects, JSON schema, and function calling. The 24 matched requests contain 72 expert-entered forms and their finite-state workflow; the enhanced parser uses the same fields and validation rules. Hunyuan accuracy is 0.663, 0.833, and 0.904, respectively; both comparisons against JSON objects have Holm-adjusted p-values below 0.001. The supplement also reports false clarification, execution-readiness errors, latency, and tokens. Resource evaluation uses token budgets under explicit tariffs: mean common-tariff budgets are 0.006688, 0.003943, 0.006782, and 0.026955 Chinese yuan (CNY) per request, with Qwen estimated at its published standard rate. Maintenance specifications quantify six regions, three horizons, three shortfall weights, nine admissible variable categories, six restricted information/action categories, and five workflow states, and identify form, parser, generation-schema, prompt, and provider-setting artifacts. The human comparison adds field-correction counts and review-time thresholds. These comparisons evaluate interpretation, structured generation, fixed validation, and human review."),
        "R2-3": (
            "我们同意重复调用和版本记录应共同评价服务表现，并采用每请求每服务五次独立试次。200条历史请求和48条独立请求形成4960个主试次，温度为0、top-p为1、输出上限4096 token、超时120秒。历史联合成功率为0.772、0.751、0.703和0.661，聚类区间及六组配对检验的Holm校正p值0.346—0.938完整列出。归档关联调用日期、请求与返回模型、端点版本、完整提示、解码参数、响应、token、延迟和哈希。独立请求的费用表采用记录token与明确单价，千问240次试次的标准价估算总额为0.946202元、每次0.003943元；四服务另按共同报价列出资源敏感性预算。结果分别呈现均值、区间、响应一致性、延迟和计价依据。",
            "We agree that repeated calls and version records jointly characterize service performance and use five independent trials per request and service. The 200 historical and 48 independent requests yield 4,960 primary trials, with temperature 0, top-p 1, a 4,096-token output limit, and a 120-second timeout. Historical joint success is 0.772, 0.751, 0.703, and 0.661; clustered intervals and six paired Holm-adjusted p-values of 0.346--0.938 are reported. The archive links call dates, requested and returned models, endpoint versions, complete prompts, decoding parameters, responses, tokens, latency, and hashes. The independent-request cost table combines recorded tokens with explicit rates: Qwen's 240 trials have a standard-price estimate of 0.946202 CNY in total and 0.003943 CNY per trial; all four services also receive common-tariff resource sensitivity budgets. Results separately present means, intervals, response consistency, latency, and pricing assumptions."),
        "R2-4": (
            "我们采纳了对歧义识别和逐问补全分别评价的建议。14条独立歧义请求在每项服务上各有70次初始试次；初始澄清率为0.857、0.757、0.614和0.614，所需字段提及召回率为1.000、0.760、0.760和0.670。逐问补全保留280次初始试次和421条追问响应，按上一轮明确询问的字段作答，最多三轮。DeepSeek、Qwen、ERNIE和混元的终轮匹配数为68/70、64/70、59/70和59/70，总服务时间中位数为4.18、15.68、42.43和54.10秒，平均追加回复为1.17、1.46、1.69和1.70次。匹配同时检查接受处置、区域、时域、缺额权重和人工审批。历史14个未完成案例逐案列出处置、类别与触发规则；误澄清、遗漏歧义和隐含字段情形与完整62案分母同时保留。正文、表格和补充材料使用相同匹配数量。",
            "We adopted separate evaluation of ambiguity identification and question-driven completion. The 14 independent ambiguous requests yield 70 initial trials per service; initial clarification rates are 0.857, 0.757, 0.614, and 0.614, and required-field mention recall is 1.000, 0.760, 0.760, and 0.670. Question-driven completion retains 280 initial trials and 421 follow-up responses, supplies fields explicitly requested in the preceding turn, and allows up to three turns. Terminal matches are 68/70, 64/70, 59/70, and 59/70 for DeepSeek, Qwen, ERNIE, and Hunyuan. Median total service times are 4.18, 15.68, 42.43, and 54.10 seconds, with mean additional replies of 1.17, 1.46, 1.69, and 1.70. Matching checks the accepted disposition, region, horizon, shortfall weight, and human approval. The 14 historically unfinished cases have case-level dispositions, categories, and trigger rules; false clarification, missed ambiguity, and implicit-field cases retain the complete 62-case denominator. Text, tables, and supplementary results use the same matching counts."),
        "R2-7": (
            "我们同意请求字段应直接连接计算结果，并以两组配对证据量化这一联系。22条独立可接受请求的440次真实服务字段重放中，266次通过验证、174次返回准备阶段、362次形成可解释的数值候选。通过验证的结果与独立参考备用序列一致，配对成本差为0。结果表按执行与返回分别列出服务时间、token报价预算及字段修正；返回计划平均需修正0.10、1.95、1.13和3.09个字段。澄清组的280次初始试次与421条追问响应给出终轮匹配、追加回复和总服务时间。九份受控规格覆盖区域、时域、变量、费用权重、可靠性和报告六类字段：区域替换的覆盖率为0.430、成本增量0.10153；120/180分钟时域的备用增量为207.3/460.2 MW，成本增量为0.00293/0.00660；变量缩减、缺额权重增加和可靠性提高的成本增量为0.00028、0.00118和0.00073。正确接受、返回补全、澄清及字段偏差各以其实际资源或数值后果评价，单位和计算阶段明确对应。Elmachtoub与Grigas的决策误差损失及Bertsimas与Kallus的条件优化为该字段—决策评价提供方法依据。",
            "We agree that request fields should connect directly to calculation outcomes and quantify this link with two paired evidence sets. The 440 actual service-field replays for 22 independently authored acceptable requests contain 266 validated trials, 174 returned preparation trials, and 362 numerically interpretable candidates. Validated results match the independently labelled reference reserve series, with zero paired cost difference. Outcome tables report service time, token-tariff budgets, and field corrections for executed and returned plans; returned plans require means of 0.10, 1.95, 1.13, and 3.09 field corrections. The clarification set's 280 initial trials and 421 follow-ups give terminal matching, additional replies, and total service time. Nine controlled specifications span region, horizon, variables, cost weights, reliability, and reporting: region replacement gives 0.430 coverage and a 0.10153 cost increase; 120/180-minute horizons add 207.3/460.2 MW and 0.00293/0.00660 cost. Reduced variables, increased shortfall weight, and increased reliability add 0.00028, 0.00118, and 0.00073 cost. Correct acceptance, returned completion, clarification, and field discrepancy are evaluated through their recorded resources or numerical consequences, with units and calculation stages specified. Decision-error loss by Elmachtoub and Grigas and conditional optimization by Bertsimas and Kallus provide the methodological basis for this field-to-decision evaluation."),
        "R2-10": (
            "我们讨论后采纳了共同可靠性比较、计算配置与图形简化的建议。八种策略在同一信息边界下采用从2019年冻结的共同非负裕量，2020年起256个策略—窗口组合全部达到0.95，最低0.952。正文和补充完整列出调整后的成本、覆盖、备用MW、尾部缺额与八种策略的最低成本；相对全局校准的平均增益为0.000026、0.000187、0.000068和0.000163，四国校正区间按同一后续窗口计算。公开预测器为220轮、63叶、学习率0.04的分位数梯度提升模型，采用固定窗口种子、256近邻和五个收缩候选；场景比较使用41个残差场景，选择依据来自测试前十天。各策略共享每个滚动起点的基础预测，计算预算由模型迭代、场景数量及邻域规模给出。补充材料中的资源例评价指定总备用量和费用权重下的汇总资源配置。框架图突出请求、信息检查、授权计算及数值证据，滚动评价图按时间划分呈现，图中文字保留矢量形式。",
            "We discussed and adopted common-reliability comparison, computational documentation, and figure simplification. All eight policies use a common nonnegative margin frozen from 2019 under the same information boundary; all 256 later policy-window combinations reach 0.95, with a minimum of 0.952. Main and supplementary tables report adjusted cost, coverage, reserve in MW, tail shortfall, and the lowest cost among all eight policies. Mean gains over global calibration are 0.000026, 0.000187, 0.000068, and 0.000163; four-country-adjusted intervals use the same later windows. The public predictor is a quantile gradient-boosting model with 220 iterations, 63 leaves, and learning rate 0.04, fixed window seeds, 256 neighbors, and five shrinkage candidates. Scenario comparisons use 41 residual scenarios, and selection uses the ten preceding days. Policies share the base prediction at each rolling origin; iterations, scenario count, and neighborhood size define computational budgets. The supplementary resource example evaluates aggregate allocation under specified reserve quantities and cost weights. The framework figure emphasizes requests, information checks, authorized calculation, and numerical evidence; the rolling figure presents chronological splits, and figure text remains vector-based."),
        "R3-1": (
            "我们采纳了以独立分析人员请求评价研究范围的建议。48条独立编写的研究准备请求经三人分别标注，24条共同任务进一步包含72份专家计划和24份书面审批。正文将研究对象定义为离线能源研究准备与验证，结果对应这些请求类别、已记录服务设置和实际计算流程。",
            "We adopted evaluation using independently authored analyst requests. Three annotators assess 48 independently written study-preparation requests; 24 matched tasks additionally contain 72 expert plans and 24 written reviews. The manuscript defines the study as offline energy-study preparation and validation, with results corresponding to these request classes, recorded service configurations, and executed calculations."),
        "R3-2": (
            "我们同意版本记录应与每个结果永久关联。归档保存请求和返回模型、实际日期、端点版本、完整提示、解码参数、响应标识、token、延迟与SHA-256哈希，并分别保留初始提交与修订评价的服务配置。6680份完整响应包含4960份主评估、1440份接口比较和280份确认终轮；421份逐问补全响应通过其独立对话记录关联初始试次。每个结果均可定位到所用模型配置及原始响应。",
            "We agree that version records should remain permanently associated with each result. The archive preserves requested and returned models, dates, endpoint versions, complete prompts, decoding parameters, response identifiers, tokens, latency, and SHA-256 hashes, with original-submission and revision configurations retained separately. The 6,680 completed responses comprise 4,960 primary, 1,440 interface, and 280 terminal-confirmation responses; the 421 question-driven follow-ups link to initial trials through their separate dialogue records. Each result is associated with its evaluated model configuration and original response."),
        "R3-5": (
            "我们采纳了人工专家配对比较，并增加可复算的字段修正工作量与复核时间阈值。三位专家对相同24条请求准备72份计划，处置准确率均为1.000，字段准确率为1.000、1.000和0.825，平均自估准备时间为2.93—3.25分钟。每项服务120次配对试次中，200个参考明确字段分别有150、109、119和78个正确，需要修正50、91、81和122个字段；处置修正为25、28、53和51次，各组执行就绪错误为0。按每请求专家平均自估时间减去该请求服务延迟，复核预算中位数为175.4、170.3、160.6和155.6秒；完整准备时间由服务返回与人工复核相加，低于该预算的复核满足专家时间参照。该阈值作为推导结果报告。新增两篇经核验的人工协作文献：Noy与Zhang对453名专业人员写作任务的随机实验报告时间下降40%、质量提高18%；Vaccaro等综合106项研究、370个效应量，说明任务类型与协作表现的联系。正文据此分别评价草拟质量、修正工作量与最终授权。",
            "We adopted the matched human-expert comparison and added reproducible field-correction workload and review-time thresholds. Three experts prepare 72 plans for the same 24 requests, with disposition accuracy of 1.000, field accuracy of 1.000, 1.000, and 0.825, and mean self-estimated preparation time of 2.93--3.25 minutes. Across each service's 120 paired trials, 200 reference-specified fields contain 150, 109, 119, and 78 correct entries, requiring 50, 91, 81, and 122 field corrections; disposition corrections number 25, 28, 53, and 51, and all groups have zero execution-readiness errors. Subtracting each request's service latency from its mean expert preparation estimate gives median review budgets of 175.4, 170.3, 160.6, and 155.6 seconds. Total preparation adds service return and human review; review below the budget meets the expert-time reference. These thresholds are reported as derived results. Two verified human-collaboration references provide context: Noy and Zhang's randomized professional-writing experiment with 453 participants reports 40-percent lower time and 18-percent higher quality; Vaccaro et al. synthesize 106 studies and 370 effect sizes and relate collaboration performance to task type. The manuscript evaluates drafting quality, correction workload, and final authorization separately."),
        "R3-7": (
            "我们同意澄清负担应与完成结果同时量化。历史41条澄清请求及48/62完成结果保留完整分母，14个未完成案例逐案分析。独立对话比较覆盖14请求、每服务70次初始试次，分别报告一次统一确认和最多三轮逐问补全。一次确认平均379.7字符；逐问补全共有421条追加响应，四服务平均追加回复为1.17、1.46、1.69和1.70次，终轮匹配为68/70、64/70、59/70和59/70，总服务时间中位数为4.18、15.68、42.43和54.10秒。两类协议各自明确输入、分母和完成指标，结果直接呈现回复负担、终轮字段质量与服务时间。",
            "We agree that clarification burden should accompany completion outcomes. The historical 41 clarification cases and 48/62 completion result retain their denominators, with case-level analysis of the 14 unfinished requests. The independent dialogue comparison covers 14 requests and 70 initial trials per service and reports one uniform confirmation and up to three question-driven turns separately. The uniform confirmation averages 379.7 characters. Question-driven completion contains 421 follow-ups, with mean additional replies of 1.17, 1.46, 1.69, and 1.70; terminal matches are 68/70, 64/70, 59/70, and 59/70, and median total service times are 4.18, 15.68, 42.43, and 54.10 seconds. Each protocol specifies its inputs, denominator, and completion metric, directly reporting reply burden, terminal field quality, and service time."),
        "R3-11": (
            "我们同意应在共同可靠性要求下评价成本，并采用完整八策略的冻结裕量比较。2019年估计的共同非负裕量用于2020年起八个窗口，256个策略—窗口均达到0.95，最低0.952。调整后的覆盖、成本、备用MW和尾部缺额按同一时间窗口完整列出；最低平均成本分别对应德国的分位数预测、奥地利和比利时的情景分位数及荷兰的所选局部策略。相对全局校准，所选局部平均增益为0.000026、0.000187、0.000068和0.000163。采用3000次三月移动块抽样及四国Bonferroni校正，奥地利和荷兰区间下界为正。德国所选局部的尾部缺额为106.18 MW，分位数预测为118.67 MW，结果同时呈现费用与尾部风险的选择。正文的成本论证对应这一共同最低可靠性协议及其后续窗口。",
            "We agree that cost should be evaluated under a common reliability requirement and use the complete eight-policy frozen-margin comparison. The shared nonnegative margin estimated in 2019 is applied to eight windows beginning in 2020; all 256 policy-window combinations reach 0.95, with a minimum of 0.952. Adjusted coverage, cost, reserve in MW, and tail shortfall are reported for the same windows. Lowest mean costs correspond to the quantile predictor in Germany, the scenario quantile in Austria and Belgium, and selected-local calibration in the Netherlands. Selected-local mean gains over global calibration are 0.000026, 0.000187, 0.000068, and 0.000163. With 3,000 three-month moving-block draws and four-country Bonferroni adjustment, Austria and the Netherlands have positive lower endpoints. Germany's selected-local tail shortfall is 106.18 MW, compared with 118.67 MW for the quantile predictor, displaying the cost and tail-risk choice together. The cost argument corresponds to this shared minimum reliability protocol and its later windows."),
        "R3-15": (
            "我们采纳了明确人工审批岗位、输入和实际记录的建议。备用研究审核人员依据请求原文、研究字段、信息可用时间规则、证据要求及审批要求完成24份书面决定，其中4份通过、9份退回补全、11份拒绝。记录列出允许修正的字段、再次送审步骤和授权状态。正文分别说明书面研究审核与历史布尔审批门，各自对应所评价流程中的实际信息和决定。数值程序在字段确认和授权后生成结果证据。",
            "We adopted explicit reporting of the approval role, inputs, and records. A reserve-study reviewer uses the original request, study fields, information-availability rules, evidence requirements, and approval requirement to provide 24 written decisions: four approvals, nine returns for completion, and eleven rejections. Records identify permitted field corrections, renewed review steps, and authorized states. The manuscript describes written study review and the historical Boolean approval gate separately, each corresponding to its evaluated information and decisions. The numerical program generates result evidence after field confirmation and authorization."),
        "R3-16": (
            "我们同意结论应对应所评价的能源研究任务。第8节总结168条请求的三人标注、72份专家计划、24共同请求上的480服务试次、四国138240个公开负荷决策，以及256个冻结裕量策略—窗口结果。结论同时报告人工字段修正工作量、推导复核时间阈值和奥地利、荷兰相对全局校准的成本增益，围绕请求准备、信息验证、授权计算和数值证据展开。",
            "We agree that conclusions should correspond to the evaluated energy-study tasks. Section 8 summarizes three annotations for each of 168 requests, 72 expert plans, 480 service trials on 24 matched requests, 138,240 public-load decisions in four countries, and 256 frozen-margin policy-window outcomes. Conclusions also report reference-field correction workload, derived review-time thresholds, and cost gains over global calibration in Austria and the Netherlands, addressing request preparation, information validation, authorized calculation, and numerical evidence."),
    })
    pairs.update({
        "R1-1": (
            "感谢您指出决策时信息边界的关键作用。方法、框架图和讨论明确时间信息、显式字段、数值证据与授权的检查。48条独立请求、每接口五次试次的对照中，混元JSON对象、JSON模式和函数调用的准确率为0.663、0.833和0.904，三组执行就绪错误均为0。结构化表单、有限状态流程和增强解析器共享相同字段与检查规则，结果分别评价字段解释和固定验证。",
            "Thank you for identifying the role of the decision-time information boundary. The method, framework figure, and Discussion define checks of temporal information, explicit fields, numerical evidence, and authorization. Across 48 independent requests and five trials per interface, Hunyuan accuracy is 0.663, 0.833, and 0.904 for JSON objects, JSON schema, and function calling; all three groups have zero execution-readiness errors. Structured forms, a finite-state workflow, and the enhanced parser share the same fields and checks, with results evaluating field interpretation and fixed validation separately."),
        "R2-2": (
            "我们同意基准独立性需要具体的来源和标注证据。三位来自电力市场运行、电网可靠性和能源预测的专业人员分别评审120条冻结盲测请求及48条独立请求，共504条记录。另一运行分析人员独立编写48条研究准备请求，包含缩略表达、改写、错字、混合语言、字段冲突和控制绕过情形。120条样本的一致性为1.000；48条独立请求的Fleiss κ为0.932，三项分歧经书面裁决。材料提供标注指引、人员背景、类别分布、生成过程、裁决和九项历史标签差异的版本记录。逐问补全进一步评价14条独立歧义请求的字段补全结果。",
            "We agree that benchmark independence requires specific provenance and annotation evidence. Three professionals from electricity-market operations, grid reliability, and energy forecasting independently assess 120 frozen blind requests and 48 independent requests, yielding 504 records. Another operations analyst authors the 48 study-preparation requests, covering shorthand, paraphrases, typographical errors, mixed languages, field conflicts, and control-bypass cases. Agreement is 1.000 on the 120-request sample; Fleiss' kappa is 0.932 on the independent set, with three disagreements adjudicated in writing. Materials report instructions, expertise, class distributions, generation, adjudication, and version records for nine historical-label differences. Question-driven completion further evaluates field resolution on 14 independent ambiguous requests."),
        "R2-5": (
            "我们讨论后采纳了加强讨论论证的建议。第6节以结果解释四个环节：接口结构与处置准确率、澄清及字段修正工作量、区域残差与可靠性、请求到计算的传递。论据包括混元接口准确率0.663、0.833和0.904，四服务50、91、81和122项字段修正，九份计算规格的备用与成本变化，以及256项共同可靠性比较。冻结协议下奥地利和荷兰的成本增益区间下界为正，各国最低成本策略和尾部缺额一起解释区域选择。两篇人工协作研究提供草拟、检查和最终决定分别评价的方法背景。每项机制说明均对应表格、数量和评价条件。",
            "We discussed and adopted the recommendation to strengthen the Discussion. Section 6 explains four components through results: interface structure and disposition accuracy, clarification and field-correction workload, regional residuals and reliability, and request-to-calculation transfer. Evidence includes Hunyuan interface accuracies of 0.663, 0.833, and 0.904; service field-correction counts of 50, 91, 81, and 122; reserve and cost changes across nine specifications; and 256 common-reliability comparisons. Austria and the Netherlands have positive cost-gain interval endpoints under the frozen protocol; the lowest-cost policy and tail shortfall jointly explain regional selection. Two human-collaboration studies motivate separate evaluation of drafting, checking, and final decisions. Each mechanism refers to quantities, tables, and evaluation conditions."),
        "R2-8": (
            "我们同意时间依赖和自适应选择应进入统计评价。实验在拟合、校准、选择和测试交界处按目标结束时间筛选，报告目标与残差的一阶相关、有效样本量、非重叠时域块最大残差、季节和高爬坡覆盖。校准长度、近邻数量、收缩、筛选阈值和带宽分别进行敏感性评价。德国四窗带宽因子0.5、1.0和2.0对应平均有效样本量199.6、251.4和255.7，成本0.01653、0.01656和0.01656，所有测试窗均达到0.95。冻结裕量成本比较按八个后续窗口进行移动块配对抽样，块长度1—4月及四国多重校正结果完整归档。正文以相应时间划分下的经验覆盖解释可靠性。",
            "We agree that temporal dependence and adaptive selection should enter statistical evaluation. Target end times determine eligibility at fitting, calibration, selection, and test boundaries. Results report lag-one target and residual correlation, effective sample size, nonoverlapping horizon-block maximum residuals, and seasonal and high-ramp coverage. Sensitivity covers calibration length, neighbors, shrinkage, screening thresholds, and bandwidth. Across four German windows, bandwidth factors of 0.5, 1.0, and 2.0 give mean effective sample sizes of 199.6, 251.4, and 255.7 and costs of 0.01653, 0.01656, and 0.01656; every test window reaches 0.95. Frozen-margin cost comparison uses paired moving blocks on eight later windows, with block lengths of one to four months and four-country adjustment archived. Reliability is interpreted as empirical coverage under its chronological split."),
        "R2-9": (
            "我们讨论后采纳了公开高分辨率复现和空间天气评价。四国公开15分钟负荷提供48个滚动窗口、138240个留出决策，补充材料记录来源、完整值筛选、重复时间处理、15分钟重索引、时区和目标边界规则。负荷、备用与缺额均以MW表示，成本采用明确权重和校准期平均负荷尺度。德国六个空间分布气象站的温度与湿度按等权平均并延后一小时进入模型，八个30天窗口每方案含23040个决策。天气输入使预测pinball损失由31.10降至30.56 MW、所选局部成本由0.01968降至0.01953；逐窗覆盖与聚合结果同时呈现。价格权重通过公开定义的无量纲成本评价，空间汇总方法通过站点清单和观测时间规则复核。",
            "We discussed and adopted public high-resolution replication and spatial-weather evaluation. Four-country public 15-minute load supplies 48 rolling windows and 138,240 held-out decisions. The supplement records sources, complete-value screening, duplicate handling, 15-minute reindexing, time zones, and target-boundary rules. Load, reserve, and shortfall use MW; cost uses stated weights and calibration-period mean load. Temperature and humidity from six geographically distributed German stations enter as equal-weight averages with a one-hour lag. Eight 30-day windows provide 23,040 decisions per variant. Weather inputs reduce predictor pinball loss from 31.10 to 30.56 MW and selected-local cost from 0.01968 to 0.01953; window-level coverage accompanies aggregate results. Price weights are evaluated through the defined dimensionless objective, and station lists and observation-time rules make the spatial aggregation reproducible."),
        "R3-3": (
            "我们采纳了重复调用评价。200条历史请求与48条独立请求在每项服务上各执行五次，形成4960个主试次，采用同一指令和解码参数。结果报告请求内平均表现、按相同请求文本聚类的区间、处置一致性及配对多重校正。正式响应按计划试次、模型配置与哈希关联，重复次数和各类分母在表格中明确列出。",
            "We adopted repeated-call evaluation. Each of the 200 historical and 48 independent requests receives five calls per service, yielding 4,960 primary trials under the same instructions and decoding parameters. Results report within-request averages, intervals clustered by identical request text, disposition consistency, and paired multiplicity adjustment. Formal responses link to planned trials, model configurations, and hashes, with repetitions and denominators specified in the tables."),
        "R3-4": (
            "感谢您要求明确综合指标和类别结果。联合成功定义为同次响应通过全部适用的结构、语义、信息、证据、审批、解析及数值来源检查。混淆矩阵列出接受、澄清、拒绝、部分接受及无效输出，分别报告模型处置与验证后处置。独立48请求的每服务分母为240次；历史联合成功率为0.772、0.751、0.703和0.661，类别计数、聚类区间与分项指标可逐项核对。",
            "Thank you for requesting explicit composite and class-specific results. Joint success requires the same response to pass every applicable structure, meaning, information, evidence, approval, parsing, and numerical-provenance check. Confusion matrices report accept, clarify, reject, partial accept, and invalid output, with model and validated dispositions evaluated separately. The independent 48-request set has 240 trials per service; historical joint-success rates are 0.772, 0.751, 0.703, and 0.661, with class counts, clustered intervals, and component metrics reported."),
        "R3-6": (
            "我们同意您的归因。摘要、方法、结果、讨论和结论将显式默认值检查的执行边界作用归于固定验证。200请求的配对比较中，41条歧义请求返回澄清，规则违规执行率由0.205降至0。语言模型生成候选字段，共享固定检查确定执行资格；结构化表单、增强解析器及受约束生成的同规则比较明确这两项职责。",
            "We agree with this attribution. The abstract, method, results, Discussion, and conclusions assign the execution-boundary effect of explicit-default checking to fixed validation. In the paired 200-request comparison, 41 ambiguous requests return for clarification and rule-violating execution falls from 0.205 to zero. Language models generate candidate fields, and shared fixed checks determine execution eligibility; matched forms, the enhanced parser, and constrained generation clarify these responsibilities."),
        "R3-8": (
            "我们同意应明确两部分的传递关系。22条独立请求的每服务110次字段重放直接读取区域、时域和缺额权重；266次通过验证的计算与独立参考备用序列及成本一致，174次返回准备阶段。九份规格覆盖六类字段并追踪目标、预测、校准和报告变化。执行与返回组的时间、字段修正和token预算，以及澄清组的追加回复与终轮匹配共同呈现工作流程。方法和讨论将计算资格归于验证，将备用、覆盖和成本归于数值预测与校准。",
            "We agree that the hand-off between the two components should be explicit. Each service's 110 replays for 22 independent requests read region, horizon, and shortfall weight directly. The 266 validated calculations match the independently labelled reference reserve series and cost, and 174 trials return to preparation. Nine specifications span six field categories and trace target, prediction, calibration, and reporting changes. Time, field corrections, and token budgets for executed and returned plans accompany clarification replies and terminal matching. The method and Discussion attribute calculation eligibility to validation and reserve, coverage, and cost to numerical prediction and calibration."),
        "R3-9": (
            "我们讨论后采纳了拓展需求不确定性背景的建议。相关文献包括八篇预测表示、需求响应、氢需求、能源—水规划、决策误差、条件优化、储能和风险套利研究，以及两篇天气集合与空间—时间预测研究。人工准备的讨论另引用Noy与Zhang和Vaccaro等两篇协作研究，共十二篇补充文献，均经书目核验。第2.1和2.6节将输入可用时间、决策目标和条件校准对应到字段检查、共同可靠性要求及六类字段的九份计算规格；第6节将人工协作证据对应到草拟、修正工作量和授权。",
            "We discussed and adopted the broader demand-uncertainty context. Relevant literature includes eight studies on forecasting representation, demand response, hydrogen demand, energy-water planning, decision error, conditional optimization, storage, and risk-averse arbitrage, plus two studies on weather ensembles and spatial-temporal forecasting. The preparation discussion also cites collaboration studies by Noy and Zhang and Vaccaro et al., yielding twelve bibliographically verified supporting references. Sections 2.1 and 2.6 connect input availability, decision objectives, and conditional calibration with field checks, the common reliability requirement, and nine specifications spanning six field categories. Section 6 relates human-collaboration evidence to drafting, correction workload, and authorization."),
        "R3-10": (
            "我们同意按时间依赖条件解释覆盖率。正文将可靠性结果定义为相应时间划分下的经验覆盖，并报告目标边界筛选、自相关、非重叠块最大残差、季节、高爬坡、有效样本量及参数敏感性。公开主比较包含48个滚动窗口，冻结裕量比较包含256个后续策略—窗口，所有组合达到0.95。移动块抽样保留连续月份的成本差，正式覆盖性质与其统计假设明确对应。",
            "We agree that coverage should be interpreted under temporal dependence. The manuscript defines reliability as empirical coverage under its chronological split and reports target-boundary screening, autocorrelation, nonoverlapping block maxima, seasons, high-ramp states, effective sample size, and parameter sensitivity. The public benchmark has 48 rolling windows; frozen-margin comparison has 256 later policy-window combinations, all reaching 0.95. Moving-block resampling preserves consecutive monthly cost differences, and formal coverage properties are associated with their statistical assumptions."),
        "R3-12": (
            "我们采纳了敏感性解释的建议。残差状态扰动定义为状态敏感性诊断，在相同基础预测、评价数据、目标函数、选择期和收缩候选下逐列置换状态坐标，再比较选择成本和备用结果。诊断采用700天拟合、20天校准拟合和10天选择的时间划分，结果解释为所规定状态扰动下的响应变化。",
            "We adopted the sensitivity interpretation. Residual-state perturbation is defined as a state-sensitivity diagnostic: state coordinates are permuted column by column under fixed base predictions, evaluation data, objective, selection period, and shrinkage candidates, followed by comparison of selection cost and reserve outcomes. The diagnostic uses 700 fitting days, 20 calibration-fitting days, and 10 selection days, with results interpreted as responses to the specified state perturbation."),
        "R3-13": (
            "我们同意尺度和费用公式应便于核对。公开负荷、备用和缺额以MW表示，成本指数定义为备用与缺额按1和20加权后的均值除以校准期平均负荷。正文优先报告公共物理量、无量纲成本及配对成本差；原匿名结果在补充材料中保留其相对比较和归一化说明。冻结可靠性比较同时列出覆盖、成本、备用及尾部缺额，使每项费用结果对应明确的服务条件。",
            "We agree that scale and cost formulas should be explicit. Public load, reserve, and shortfall use MW. The cost index is mean reserve and shortfall weighted by 1 and 20, respectively, divided by calibration-period mean load. Main results report public physical quantities, dimensionless cost, and paired cost differences; original anonymized results retain their relative comparisons and normalization in the supplement. Frozen-reliability tables present coverage, cost, reserve, and tail shortfall together, linking each cost outcome to its service condition."),
        "R3-14": (
            "我们采纳了分季节和极端爬坡评价。补充材料按四季及训练期近期爬坡80分位阈值定义的高爬坡组，分别列出样本量、预测损失、残差相关、覆盖、备用MW和成本。奥地利春季覆盖为0.918、高爬坡组为0.915，这些条件结果与整体覆盖一起报告。分组采用决策时观测信息，预测误差与校准结果各有对应指标。",
            "We adopted seasonal and extreme-ramp evaluation. The supplement reports sample size, prediction loss, residual correlation, coverage, reserve in MW, and cost by season and by high-ramp groups defined using the training-period 80th percentile of recent ramps. Austria's spring coverage is 0.918 and high-ramp coverage is 0.915, with conditional and overall results reported together. Groups use decision-time observations, and prediction error and calibration outcomes have separate metrics."),
    })
    for key, (chinese, english) in pairs.items():
        chinese = chinese.replace("未来", "后续观测") if key == "R3-10" else chinese
        english = english.replace("The manuscript uses these results for empirical monitoring and confines finite-sample coverage properties to analyses with the corresponding assumptions.", "The chronological results describe empirical coverage and its variation across the recorded regimes.")
        pairs[key] = (chinese, english)
    chinese, english = pairs["R2-10"]
    pairs["R2-10"] = (
        chinese.replace("计算预算由模型迭代、场景数量及邻域规模给出。", "计算预算由模型迭代、场景数量及邻域规模给出。八个后续窗口中，共享模型拟合与预测阶段的平均记录耗时在四国分别为0.550、0.539、0.546和0.555秒，策略专属计算量由近邻、候选和场景数对应。"),
        english.replace("iterations, scenario count, and neighborhood size define computational budgets.", "iterations, scenario count, and neighborhood size define computational budgets. Across the eight later windows, the shared fitting-and-prediction stage has mean recorded times of 0.550, 0.539, 0.546, and 0.555 seconds in the four countries; neighborhood, candidate, and scenario counts specify policy-specific work."),
    )
    return pairs
